 "kind": "statement",
 "title": "Factors of a finite-type effective Cartier product",
 "statement": "Let $R$ be a ring and let $I,J\\subseteq R$ be ideals. If $IJ$\nis an effective Cartier ideal, then $I$ and $J$ are effective Cartier ideals.",
 "source": {
  "document": "literature/blueprint/master/blueprint/sec-nagata-compactification/sk-lem-nagata-sketch-blowups/lemma-nagata-ideal-invertible-product-factor.md",
